@startuml
title Logical Database Ownership
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Authentication Module" as Auth
component "Complaint Module" as Complaint
component "Department Module" as Department
component "Notification Module" as Notification
component "GIS Module" as GIS
component "Reporting Module" as Reporting

database auth_db
database complaint_db
database department_db
database notification_db
database gis_db
database reporting_db

Auth --> auth_db : owns reads/writes
Complaint --> complaint_db : owns reads/writes
Department --> department_db : owns reads/writes
Notification --> notification_db : owns reads/writes
GIS --> gis_db : owns reads/writes
Reporting --> reporting_db : owns derived data

Complaint ..> Auth : user identity interface
Complaint ..> Department : category/routing interface
Complaint ..> GIS : location interface
Complaint ..> Notification : domain event
Reporting ..> Complaint : reporting contract/events
Reporting ..> Department : reporting contract

note bottom
  Cross-database identifiers are allowed.
  Cross-database foreign keys and direct cross-owner writes are prohibited.
end note
@enduml

